        "title": "My Tracks stays at the top of the user layer list",
        "owners": [
          "app",
          "maplib",
          "maplibui"
        ],
        "statement": "Keep every direct tracks layer last in internal LayerGroup order so it is first in the reversed UI list, and insert Collector project layers below it. Native rendering separately puts every saved/current track pass below whole named standard field-line and actual Point/MultiPoint vector groups, using exact current source identity and canonical model relative order independently from source registration arrival; transient tools and GPS remain above them.",
